Hi <%= @requester.name %>,

Thanks for requesting a tour at <%= @location&.name || @operator.name %> — we got it!
<% if @location && [@location.building_address, @location.city].any?(&:present?) %>
You'll find us at <%= [@location.building_address, @location.city, @location.state].select(&:present?).join(", ") %>.
<% end %>
<% if @preferred_time.present? %>
You mentioned "<%= @preferred_time %>" works for you — someone from the team will reach out shortly to confirm a time.
<% else %>
Someone from the team will reach out shortly to set up a time.
<% end %>

See you soon!

— The <%= @operator.name %> team
